metadata/_sms_note = "Pass 153: KING BOO (BossTelesa), Casino Delfino's boss. Easiest: drop assets/Sms/Enemy/BossTelesa/KingBooArena.tscn (the three roulette discs + him) into the level; on his own he needs three SmsRoulette discs in the scene (the sms_roulette group) and sits over the floor under him. He hangs 11 m up over the table's centre with his slot machine under him, hidden for HideWaitTicks first. Spray his TONGUE: the slot rolls; three FRUIT and he spits a fan of fruit and two RED PEPPERS; throw a pepper at his tongue (he turns spicy and solid) and THEN a fruit at his body: a hit point off, he flees and the discs spin faster; a fruit on him while not spicy only makes him flinch and laugh. Three hits (HitPoints) and he is down: the Shine. Between rounds he hides; waiting, he spits Boo attackers every few seconds (SpitsBooAttackers). Stand within 4 m of the table's centre under him and he vanishes (HidesWhenMarioUnder). Ground-pound a disc's switch pad to stop that disc. Knobs: The arena (the discs, the slot, the Shine), The fight (HitPoints, HideWaitTicks, RoundTimeScale, the slot rates, ForceResult for a custom fight, CoinRounds), What he spits (the fruit / coin / enemy scenes, the Boo), Deviations (speed scales, the attackers, the hide), Effects, Camera, Sounds."

